she's walking free within a year or two. ", "author": "SmiggieBalls", "created": 1788527612262, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Emperorvoid", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "70% of psychologists are women. 91% of psychologists are Democrats. Mass is a Democrat state. If Lindsay gets sent to a mental institution, she walks free. ", "last_comment_created": 1788565462620, "content": "<p>I see a fair number of people posting about how they think that Lindsay Clancy should be sent to a mental institution for life.</p>\n<p>Massachusetts doesn't do that. The jury can either declare her guilty and send her to prison, or <em>not guilty</em> by reason of mental defect, and send her to a mental institution. Key words: not guilty.</p>\n<p>In Mass, once someone is committed, they are evaluated for 6 months, and then have reevaluations every year after that. And if a doctor declares them cured, <em>they just get released</em>. They were found not guilty. There's no prison or lifelong commitment. They're committed until a psychologist says they're better, and they they walk free and clear.</p>\n<p>And with Mass being a Democrat state, 70% of psychologists being women, and 91% being Democrats...she's walking free within a year or two.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 12, "score_up": 169, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATV8B99Yj", "is_twitter":